@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### ---------- Health ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ---------- Projects ----------
### List: pagination + search + sort (response header X-Db-Query-Count = 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?page=1&pageSize=5&search=demo&sort=-createdAt,name

### Filter by owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?ownerId=2

### Get one (nested owner, members, tasks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1

### Create (owner 2 = seeded manager) -> 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New project", "description": "Created via .http file", "ownerId": 2 }

### Update (PUT) -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo project (renamed)", "description": "Updated" }

### Add member (idempotent) -> 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/members/1

### Remove member -> 204 (409 for the owner or a member with assigned tasks)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/members/1

### Delete project (cascades tasks/comments) -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/999999

### ---------- Tasks ----------
### Global list: filters + sort (high priority, not done, soonest due date first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?priority=High&status=InProgress&sort=dueDate&page=1&pageSize=10

### Tasks of one project with search and due-date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/2/tasks?search=demo&dueFrom=2026-10-24&dueTo=2026-12-31&sort=-priority,title

### Get one (nested project, assignee, comments with authors, attachments)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1

### Create task in project 1 -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Implement CRUD", "description": "Stage 2", "priority": "High", "assigneeId": 3 }

### Update task (PUT = full replacement) -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Set up repository", "status": "Done", "priority": "High", "assigneeId": 2 }

### Change only the status (PATCH) -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Done" }

### Delete task -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/999999

### ---------- Comments ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/3/comments?sort=-createdAt

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/3/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Looks good", "authorId": 2 }

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Edited comment" }

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1

### ---------- Users ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=Member&search=team&sort=displayName

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.user@example.com", "displayName": "New User", "role": "Member" }

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "member@example.com", "displayName": "Team Member", "role": "Member" }

### Owner of projects -> 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2

### ---------- Errors (all application/problem+json) ----------
### 400 validation: errors map with camelCase keys
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "ownerId": 0 }

### 400 owner does not exist (field "ownerId")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "ownerId": 999999 }

### 400 malformed JSON / unknown enum value
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bad", "priority": "Urgent" }

### 400 unknown sort field
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?sort=password

### 400 invalid paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?page=0&pageSize=1000

### 404 resource not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/999999

### 409 duplicate e-mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "displayName": "Duplicate" }

### 422 assignee is not a member of the project (admin id 1 is not in project 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Needs member", "assigneeId": 1 }

### 405 method not allowed
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
